 r←Test_Input_Misc_021(stopFlag batchFlag);n;⎕TRAP;defMat;res;DT;parms
⍝ Exercise "Input" with `conformCancel←1`
 r←T._Failed
 ⎕TRAP←(999 'C' '. ⍝ Deliberate error')(0 'N')

 DT←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Enums.InputDataTypes

 defMat←0 4⍴0
 defMat⍪←'Name' 'Enter your name:' ''DT.Character

 parms←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.CreateParms
 parms.confirmCancel←1
 parms.testMode←1
 n←#.APLGUI.APLGUI.Input.Create defMat parms ⍬

 n.Name ∆KeyPress'Kai Jaeger'
 ⎕NQ n.∆Cancel'Select'
 ∆Process n.∆Form
 →T.PassesIf ⍬≡n.∆result
 →T.PassesIf n.∆Form.∆closed

 r←T._OK
